cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the specification below. The
  preferred citation is the archived specification, not this repository.
title: "ctier-engine: Reference Implementation of Consequence-Tiered API Governance"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of consequence-tiered API governance for
  autonomous agents. A build-time library classifies API operations by
  the consequence of executing them incorrectly and compiles that
  classification into gateway-native configuration. Companion to the
  ctier specification (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22020288).
